SUMMARY:[Curated Role Feeds] Fisheries of the Northeastern United States\;
  Atlantic Bluefish Fishery\; Quota Transfer From New York to North Carolin
 a
DESCRIPTION:NMFS announces that the State of New York is transferring a po
 rtion of their 2026 commercial bluefish quota to the State of North Caroli
 na. This quota adjustment is necessary to comply with the Atlantic Bluefis
 h Fishery Management Plan (FMP) quota transfer provisions. This announceme
 nt informs the public of the revised 2026 commercial bluefish quotas for N
 ew York and North Carolina.\nhttps://www.federalregister.gov/documents/202
