DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261013
SUMMARY:[Curated Role Feeds] Maine Day of Soccer - October 15
DESCRIPTION:WHEREAS\n\, since their founding\, the Hearts of Pine have bro
 ught together soccer fans new and old from across Maine to join in a love 
 for the game\, community and our state\; and\nWHEREAS\n\, the Hearts have 
 been a remarkable success on and off the field\, reaching the semifinals o
 f the playoffs in their inaugural season\, selling out over 30 consecutive
  games at Fitzpatrick Stadium\, and attracting fans from in and out of Mai
 ne to Portland for the experience\; and\nWHEREAS\n\, the USL W League is a
  pre-professional women’s soccer league that brings high level college-e
 ligible athletes together for a summer season running from May-July\; and\
 nWHEREAS\n\, women in sports deserve greater visibility and opportunity\, 
 and Maine people are ready for a women’s team that reflects the talent\,
  ambition\, and spirit that already exists across this state\; and\nWHEREA
 S\n\, in town halls\, community gatherings\, virtual discussions\, and one
 -on-one conversations\, Maine people have demonstrated their excitement fo
 r bringing a women’s team to Portland\; and\nWHEREAS\n\, 5\,000 season t
 ickets were sold out in just one hour\, further representing the energy al
 ready behind the team\; and\nWHEREAS\n\, we eagerly await the start of the
  2027 season to welcome our new USL W team home\;\nNOW THEREFORE\n\, be it
  resolved that I\, Janet T. Mills\, Governor of the State of Maine\, do he
 reby proclaim October 15\, 2026 as\nMaine Day of Soccer\nthroughout the st
 ate\, and I urge all residents to give a warm welcome to our new USL W fra
 nchise in Maine.\nIn testimony whereof\, I have caused\nthe Great Seal of 
 the State to be\nhereunto affixed GIVEN under my\nhand at Augusta this eig
 hth day of\nOctober Two Thousand Twenty-Six\nhttp://www.maine.gov/governor
 /mills/official_documents/proclamations/2026-10-maine-day-soccer-october-1
 5
URL:http://www.maine.gov/governor/mills/official_documents/proclamations/2
 026-10-maine-day-soccer-october-15
CATEGORIES:Curated Role Feeds
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
