SUMMARY:[Curated Role Feeds] Fisheries of the Northeastern United States\;
  Summer Flounder Fishery\; 2026 Commercial Quota Harvested for the State o
 f Maine
DESCRIPTION:NMFS announces that the 2026 summer flounder commercial quota 
 allocated to the State of Maine has been harvested. Vessels issued a comme
 rcial Federal fisheries permit for the summer flounder fishery may not lan
 d summer flounder in Maine for the remainder of calendar year 2026\, unles
 s additional quota becomes available through a transfer from another state
 . Regulations governing the summer flounder fishery require publication of
  this notification to advise Maine that the quota has been harvested\, and
  to advise vessel permit holders and dealer permit holders that no Federal
  commercial quota is available for landing summer flounder in Maine.\nhttp
 s://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2026/10/13/2026-20861/fisheries-of-t
 he-northeastern-united-states-summer-flounder-fishery-2026-commercial-quot
 a-harvested
URL:https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2026/10/13/2026-20861/fisher
 ies-of-the-northeastern-united-states-summer-flounder-fishery-2026-commerc
 ial-quota-harvested
CATEGORIES:Curated Role Feeds
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
